From 4b1be50c84df15b7c21d4a977f346c89dc3b4c44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 15:44:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] [tests/gtest]: implement prefix verification

Implements core functions for sending prefix updates to the running BGP
instance and verifying the existence of prefixes within the TED and RIB.

New functions perform the following:

- Converts a `LinkStatePrefix` to FRR's native data structure
- Sends a prefix message across the FRR bridge
- Arranges initial state of test case within a separate function
- Converts model link and prefix NLRI structs into `BApiLinkStateUpdate`
  messages for conveniently passing to the running BGP instance

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
